<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Okomu Oil reports profit rise.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Okomu Oil reports profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Nigerian oilpalm company Okomu Oil to end-December 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    1996	1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    675.547   550.859</p>
<p> Investment income	   5.980     7.774</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   95.964    64.167</p>
<p> Taxation			2.746     4.679</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    93.218    59.488</p>
<p> Dividend per share	25 kobo   15 kobo</p>
<p> Payment date - August 7, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
